out+=['','The numeric table includes two planned Task deletion inputs that were not reached; they are not counted among the 18 actual input observations. Cross-consumer score comparison aligns Task Category index with wrapper output position; Task ranked-list position is not used. Native Task raw tensors are not observed. All per-index comparison counts and maximum returned-score differences are in results.json.','', '## Build/dependency and operational record','', 'Two build attempts: initial 10 APKs all compiled/package successfully; before execution, review separated successful public API return from subsequent serialization/IO, then all 10 were rebuilt. Both attempts preserved; generated sources and fixtures unchanged. Only final attempt executed. No version fishing or source repair.', '','Exact Java/native classpaths and SHA256: `dependencies/resolved-lock.json`. Published Maven POM/AAR/JAR downloads: `dependencies/downloads.json`; exact host/compiler/SDK: `versions/versions.json`; expanded commands/stdout/stderr: `commands-executed.sh`, build and execution logs. Separate Task native library is not asserted identical to standalone TFLite 2.13.0.','', 'Fresh AVD configuration/state is under sdk/avd; installed SDK/JDK/Python are reused read-only, not rebuilt from archived inputs. SDK paths are symlinks to prior installation. Global adb server/default Android preferences are host state; this is not a hermetic host installation.','', '## Interpretation boundaries','', 'A reproduced stage contrast on the same Android API/ABI reduces the earlier OS/language contrast. The two official consumer configurations still differ in native integration and published libraries; do not infer isolated interpreter-version causality or independent implementations. Full source/javap mechanism audit is preserved separately under ../review/mechanism.', '', 'All failures are caught by instrumentation. No application crash, latency improvement, task accuracy, natural EfficientNet defect, or prevalence result is inferred. Label permutation compares exposed association relative to original; independent reference investigation belongs to P3. Agent execution is not human verification.', '']
